.Dd October 21, 2026
.Dt PRINTENV 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm printenv
.Nd print out the environment
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar name
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prints out the names and values of the variables in the environment.
if
.Ar name
is specified, only its value is printed.
